{"custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "question_text": {"Math-Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) log<sub>√2</sub>(1/16) = কত?", "option1": "- 4", "option2": "2", "option3": "6", "option4": "- 8", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> log<sub>√2</sub>(1/16) = কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>log<sub>√2</sub>(1/16)<br>= log<sub>√2</sub>(1/2<sup>4</sup>)<br>= log<sub>√2</sub>{1/(√2)<sup>8</sup>} [যেহেতু 2 = (√2)<sup>2</sup>, তাই 2<sup>4</sup> = (√2)<sup>8</sup>]<br>= log<sub>√2</sub>(√2)<sup>- 8</sup><br>= - 8 × log<sub>√2</sub>√2 ; [log<sub>a</sub>(a<sup>n</sup>) = n × log<sub>a</sub>a]<br>= - 8 × 1 ; [log<sub>a</sub>a = 1]<br>= - 8</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) 9 . 5<sup>n</sup> - 20 . 5<sup>n - 1</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "5<sup>n - 1</sup>", "option2": "5<sup>n + 1</sup>", "option3": "3<sup>n + 3</sup>", "option4": "5<sup>n</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> 9 . 5<sup>n</sup> - 20 . 5<sup>n - 1</sup> এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>9 . 5<sup>n</sup> - 20 . 5<sup>n - 1</sup><br>= 9 . 5<sup>n</sup> - 20 . (5<sup>n</sup>/5<sup>1</sup>)<br>= 9 . 5<sup>n</sup> - 4 . 5<sup>n</sup><br>= 5<sup>n</sup> (9 - 4)<br>= 5<sup>n</sup> . 5<br>= 5<sup>n + 1</sup></p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>6</sup>) = 3x এবং log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 2y হলে, xy = কত? [যেখানে a &gt; 0, a ≠ 1, b &gt; 0 এবং b ≠ 1]", "option1": "3", "option2": "1", "option3": "2/3", "option4": "4", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>6</sup>) = 3x এবং log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 2y হলে, xy = কত? [যেখানে a &gt; 0, a ≠ 1, b &gt; 0 এবং b ≠ 1]</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>দেওয়া আছে,<br>log<sub>a</sub>(b<sup>6</sup>) = 3x<br>⇒ 6 log<sub>a</sub>b = 3x<br>⇒ log<sub>a</sub>b = 3x/6<br>⇒ log<sub>a</sub>b = x/2<br>∴ x = 2 log<sub>a</sub>b</p>\r\n<p>আবার,<br>log<sub>b</sub>(a<sup>3</sup>) = 2y<br>⇒ 3 log<sub>b</sub>a = 2y<br>⇒ log<sub>b</sub>a = 2y/3<br>∴ y = (3/2) log<sub>b</sub>a</p>\r\n<p>এখন,<br>xy = (2 log<sub>a</sub>b) × (3/2 log<sub>b</sub>a)<br>⇒ xy = (2 × 3/2) × (log<sub>a</sub>b × log<sub>b</sub>a)<br>⇒ xy = 3 × 1 [যেহেতু log<sub>a</sub>b × log<sub>b</sub>a = 1]<br>∴ xy = 3</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 3<sup>2x + 3</sup> = 27<sup>x - 1</sup> হলে, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "3", "option2": "4", "option3": "6", "option4": "9", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> 3<sup>2x + 3</sup> = 27<sup>x - 1</sup> হলে, x এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>3<sup>2x + 3</sup> = 27<sup>x - 1</sup><br>⇒ 3<sup>2x + 3</sup> = (3<sup>3</sup>)<sup>x - 1</sup><br>⇒ 3<sup>2x + 3</sup> = 3<sup>3x - 3</sup><br>⇒ 2x + 3 = 3x - 3 <br>⇒ 2x - 3x = - 3 - 3<br>⇒ - x = - 6<br>∴ x = 6</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x ≠ 0 হলে, (500x)<sup>0</sup> + 500x<sup>0</sup> + (500x)<sup>0</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "1", "option2": "502", "option3": "500", "option4": "3", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> x ≠ 0 হলে, (500x)<sup>0</sup> + 500x<sup>0</sup> + (500x)<sup>0</sup> এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>(500x)<sup>0</sup> + 500x<sup>0</sup> + (500x)<sup>0 </sup>  [যেহেতু a<sup>0</sup> = 1; যেখানে a ≠ 0]<br>= 1 + (500 × 1) + 1<br>= 1 + 500 + 1<br>= 502</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) log<sub>x</sub>(0.001) = - 3 হলে, x এর মান কত?", "option1": "- 3", "option2": "5", "option3": "10", "option4": "100", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> log<sub>x</sub>(0.001) = - 3 হলে, x এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>log<sub>x</sub>(0.001) = - 3<br>⇒ x<sup>- 3</sup> = 0.001 [যেহেতু log<sub>a</sub>b = c হলে, a<sup>c</sup> = b]<br>⇒ x<sup>- 3</sup> = 1/1000<br>⇒ x<sup>- 3</sup> = 1/10<sup>3</sup><br>⇒ x<sup>- 3</sup> = 10<sup>- 3</sup><br>∴ x = 10</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) (64)<sup>0.375</sup> × (64)<sup>0.125</sup> = ?", "option1": "16", "option2": "8", "option3": "4", "option4": "64", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> (64)<sup>0.375</sup> × (64)<sup>0.125</sup> = ?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>(64)<sup>0.375</sup> × (64)<sup>0.125</sup> [আমরা জানি, a<sup>m</sup> × a<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m + n</sup>]<br>= (64)<sup>(0.375 + 0.125)</sup><br>= (64)<sup>0.50</sup><br>= (64)<sup>1/2</sup><br>= (8<sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup> [আমরা জানি, (a<sup>m</sup>)<sup>n</sup> = a<sup>m × n</sup>]<br>= 8<sup>(2 × 1/2)</sup><br>= 8<sup>1</sup><br>= 8</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809.png\" width=\"535\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "8", "option2": "16", "option3": "32", "option4": "64", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_ELgHItB.png\" width=\"502\" height=\"60\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_1.png\" width=\"564\" height=\"428\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_2.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "3", "option2": "4", "option3": "8", "option4": "16", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_2_kiX8otD.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_3.png\" width=\"285\" height=\"592\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_4.png\" width=\"451\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "8/3", "option2": "5/4", "option3": "13/4", "option4": "8/15", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_4_r6v54KO.png\" width=\"422\" height=\"71\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_5.png\" width=\"238\" height=\"611\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"72\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "9", "option2": "15", "option3": "27", "option4": "6", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_rv3IO69.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"72\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_1.png\" width=\"283\" height=\"434\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_6.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"83\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "2", "option2": "3", "option3": "6", "option4": "7", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_6_asQzzHJ.png\" width=\"574\" height=\"76\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_7.png\" width=\"373\" height=\"594\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) log<sub>2</sub>(√128) + log<sub>2</sub>{√(1/2)} = কত?", "option1": "2", "option2": "3", "option3": "4", "option4": "5", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> log<sub>2</sub>(√128) + log<sub>2</sub>{√(1/2)} = কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>আমরা জানি, log<sub>a</sub>(m) + log<sub>a</sub>(n) = log<sub>a</sub>(m × n)</p>\r\n<p>সুতরাং,<br>log<sub>2</sub>(√128) + log<sub>2</sub>{√(1/2)}<br>= log<sub>2</sub>[√{128 × (1/2)}]<br>= log<sub>2</sub>(√64)<br>= log<sub>2</sub>(8)<br>= log<sub>2</sub>(2<sup>3</sup>)<br>= 3 log<sub>2</sub>2<br>= 3 × 1 [যেহেতু log<sub>a</sub>a = 1]<br>= 3</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_8.png\" width=\"769\" height=\"80\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "11/5", "option2": "5/8", "option3": "3√3", "option4": "9/4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_8_ZSFnN3w.png\" width=\"654\" height=\"68\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_9.png\" width=\"298\" height=\"905\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "8<sup>y</sup>", "option2": "2<sup>y + 2</sup>", "option3": "2<sup>4y</sup>", "option4": "4<sup>y + 1</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup> + 2<sup>y</sup><br>= 2<sup>y</sup> (1 + 1 + 1 + 1)<br>= 2<sup>y</sup> . 4<br>= 2<sup>y</sup> . 2<sup>2</sup><br>= 2<sup>y + 2</sup></p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_10.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"84\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "x<sup>1/3</sup>", "option2": "x<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "x<sup>3</sup>", "option4": "x<sup>5</sup>", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_10_w4HHIS4.png\" width=\"194\" height=\"84\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260809_11.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"525\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_2.png\" width=\"244\" height=\"131\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "4", "option2": "16", "option3": "12", "option4": "8", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_2_CVADjz2.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"108\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_3.png\" width=\"271\" height=\"763\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) যদি log<sub>2</sub>(x + 3) + log<sub>2</sub> 3 = log<sub>2</sub>(x - 2) + 3 হয়, তাহলে x এর মান কত?", "option1": "5", "option2": "10", "option3": "20", "option4": "16", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন:</strong> যদি log<sub>2</sub>(x + 3) + log<sub>2 </sub>3 = log<sub>2</sub>(x - 2) + 3 হয়, তাহলে x এর মান কত?</p>\r\n<p><strong>সমাধান:</strong><br>log<sub>2</sub>(x + 3) + log<sub>2</sub> 3 = log<sub>2</sub>(x - 2) + 3<br>⇒ log<sub>2</sub>{(x + 3) × 3} = log<sub>2</sub>(x - 2) + log<sub>2</sub> 2<sup>3</sup>    [যেহেতু log<sub>a</sub>M + log<sub>a</sub>N = log<sub>a</sub>(MN) এবং n log<sub>a</sub>a = log<sub>a</sub>a<sup>n</sup>]<br>⇒ log<sub>2</sub>(3x + 9) = log<sub>2</sub>{(x - 2) × 8}    [3 = 3 log<sub>2</sub>2 = log<sub>2</sub>8]<br>⇒ log<sub>2</sub>(3x + 9) = log<sub>2</sub>(8x - 16)<br>⇒ 3x + 9 = 8x - 16<br>⇒ 3x - 8x = - 16 - 9<br>⇒ - 5x = - 25<br>∴ x = 5</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_4.png\" width=\"806\" height=\"100\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "2", "option2": "4", "option3": "9", "option4": "10", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_4_dgpjeNH.png\" width=\"734\" height=\"91\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_5.png\" width=\"577\" height=\"660\" alt=\"\"></p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_6.png\" width=\"271\" height=\"162\" alt=\"\">", "option1": "2/11", "option2": "4/11", "option3": "2/15", "option4": "3/10", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>প্রশ্ন: <img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_6_6WAQRmQ.png\" width=\"218\" height=\"130\" alt=\"\"><br><br>সমাধান:<br><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/math-20260810_7.png\" width=\"611\" height=\"713\" alt=\"\"></p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1320000, "pk": 16345, "is_omr": true, "omr_time": 1620000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 16345}